WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.625
You want to prove you're the GOAT?

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:05.625
This is your chance.

00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:08.500
Yeah, yeah...no problem.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.375
I mean, it's just Michael Jordan, right?

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:15.666
We must destroy that which stands in our way.

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:17.958
The Mediadel.

00:00:20.583 --> 00:00:21.916
Don't show that kind of frustration

00:00:21.916 --> 00:00:22.916
in front of Ser Jordan.

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:25.458
It's like blood in the water.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.000
Wait, what? I...

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.625
Cut away all your distractions.

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:31.625
Cut away self-doubt

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.333
and insecurity.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.333
Once you have removed all 

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:37.000
that does not serve you in battle,

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.833
you have found your Mamba form.

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:41.333
My fellow gods of tomorrow,

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:42.333
we are

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:46.916
the Dream Team's nightmare!

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.166
Alright, Dream Team.

00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:09.666
Welcome to my Eurostep! 

00:01:09.666 --> 00:01:10.875
Back screen! Back screen!

00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:12.291
Where’s the foul? Where’s the foul?

00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:13.291
James! You can’t flop!

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:14.875
Embiid’s having one of him lazy games.

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:15.625
Watch your back, Joel.

00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:16.500
Do a 180! Do a 180!

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:17.500
Get that shit out of here!

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.125
Here we go, Process. Here we go!

00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:20.791
How do you like the size of my hands?

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:23.541
Haha! Hey Larry, what do you think of this?

00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:24.541
Wait, their big men…

00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:25.541
they're shooting threes!

00:01:25.541 --> 00:01:26.541
Their big men are rangers!

00:01:26.541 --> 00:01:28.791
I’m drowning in Ewing’s sweat! 
I’m drowning in Ewing’s sweat! 

00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:29.666
Someone get Mullin!

00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:31.625
Ayy! I’m White Walkin' here!

00:01:31.625 --> 00:01:33.708
A pass for you! A pass for you!

00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:34.583
Watch Dell’s son!

00:01:34.583 --> 00:01:35.291
Where’s the help?

00:01:35.291 --> 00:01:36.083
Gobert, nice block!

00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:38.666
Time for you to taste my invisible soup!

00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:39.416
Are you seeing this?

00:01:39.416 --> 00:01:41.083
This is the craziest battle I’ve ever seen! 

00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:42.083
Watch the Chainmail Man! 

00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:43.083
Who’s got the Chainmail Man?

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:44.625
My god, I’ve never seen so much strength!

00:01:44.625 --> 00:01:46.083
Ref! Ref! His tunic’s untucked!

00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:46.708
His tunic’s untucked!

00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:47.708
You just got Processed. 

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:49.333
This is for Toni Kukoc!

00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:50.541
Ball don’t lie, bitch.

00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:51.833
Watch Drexler! Watch Drexler!

00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:52.666
Which one’s Drexler?

00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:53.875
He’s like a...worse Jordan!

00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:55.041
Watch Pippen!

00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:55.833
Punch it! Punch it!

00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:56.958
Chris, punch Pippen’s dong!

00:01:56.958 --> 00:01:57.958
Ow.

00:01:57.958 --> 00:01:59.166
Who’s on Jordan? Who’s got Jordan?

00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:00.625
Touch his face, Rudy! Touch his face!

00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:01.458
I touch his face!

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.208
YOU THINK THE PLAGUE BOTHERS ME? 

00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:05.208
HAHAHA!

00:02:05.666 --> 00:02:06.458
He’s mine.

00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:09.083
Oh LeBron, how I’ve waited for this…

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:09.958
Take it in.

00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:10.916
Because this

00:02:10.916 --> 00:02:12.125
is your LAST

00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:14.500
LAST DANCE!

00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:38.541
Good farmer!

00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:42.083
Spare some wine for your GOAT?

00:02:42.875 --> 00:02:44.375
Our goat don’t drink wine.

00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:45.375
Heh.

00:02:45.375 --> 00:02:46.916
I mean me.

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:47.875
King James.

00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:50.791
The now undisputed greatest knight of all time.

00:02:50.791 --> 00:02:51.458
Nah...

00:02:51.458 --> 00:02:53.000
nobody's better than Michael Jordan. 

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.250
Well, uh,

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.375
you know, I defeated him.

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:56.375
Saved the Realm,

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:57.125
no big deal.

00:02:57.125 --> 00:02:58.416
Heh. OK. 

00:02:58.416 --> 00:02:59.708
Is that LeBron James?

00:02:59.708 --> 00:03:00.708
Sure is.

00:03:00.708 --> 00:03:01.583
Well, what’s he want?

00:03:01.583 --> 00:03:03.541
Just a little celebratory wine is all.

00:03:03.541 --> 00:03:05.541
He says he’s better than Ser Jordan. 

00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:06.708
It’s true actually.

00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:07.750
Oh, come on.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.125
Jordan's got six rings!

00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:10.541
Yeah. Jordan’s a killer.

00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:11.916
Never lost a Finals.

00:03:11.916 --> 00:03:13.583
Says he beat him in some big battle.

00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:14.916
OK, well, Jordan’s like 60,

00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:15.833
so who gives a shit?

00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:17.791
Well actually, he was in his prime

00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:19.916
because he used magic Soul Box shards

00:03:19.916 --> 00:03:22.500
on the Dream Team and…

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.250
Have you not heard of any of this?

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:24.833
No.

00:03:24.833 --> 00:03:26.458
Well, check your highlight ravens.

00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:27.416
Haven’t gotten any.

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:29.291
What about your local sports crier?

00:03:29.291 --> 00:03:29.875
Nope.

00:03:29.875 --> 00:03:31.333
No news or nothing.

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:32.750
Social media ravens have been down

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:33.500
for a while too.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.125
Wait. So you’re telling me,

00:03:35.125 --> 00:03:37.625
we just had the biggest, most epic battle

00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:39.083
in the history of the Realm

00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:40.875
and nobody heard about it?

00:03:41.291 --> 00:03:41.916
Guess not.

00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:43.208
What the–

00:03:47.666 --> 00:03:49.250
Now THIS is great.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:52.083
Finally we can just play basketball. 

00:03:52.083 --> 00:03:54.458
No blog boys around to criticize us.

00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:56.375
We've got no haters in the stands.

00:03:56.375 --> 00:03:57.583
Yeah...it’s um…

00:03:57.583 --> 00:03:58.291
it's nice.

00:04:00.666 --> 00:04:01.875
A bit boring, though.

00:04:03.583 --> 00:04:05.041
Realm officials? 

00:04:05.041 --> 00:04:05.583
Ugh.

00:04:05.583 --> 00:04:07.583
Everyone, just be cool.

00:04:07.583 --> 00:04:08.375
Kyrie started it!

00:04:08.375 --> 00:04:09.375
Yeah this was ALL Kyrie.

00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:10.375
I don’t even know these dudes.

00:04:17.416 --> 00:04:18.458
LeBron?

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:19.666
What have you done!? 

00:04:19.666 --> 00:04:21.083
You saved the Realm.

00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:22.125
I liberated it. 

00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:24.083
You didn’t have to burn it all down.

00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:25.291
You’ve destroyed everything.

00:04:25.291 --> 00:04:27.541
The stats. The history. The stories…

00:04:27.541 --> 00:04:29.500
the gossip, the ignorant critiques,

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.250
the unfounded trade rumors.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.750
After all I’ve done for you!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.541
I finally beat Ser Jordan

00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:36.708
and now there’s no Mediadel to talk about it!

00:04:36.708 --> 00:04:39.125
Ah, so that's what this is about?

00:04:39.125 --> 00:04:42.083
That I’ve spoiled your coronation ceremony.

00:04:42.083 --> 00:04:43.541
Don’t be fooled, Ser Anthony.

00:04:43.541 --> 00:04:45.541
His whole selfless teammate act

00:04:45.541 --> 00:04:46.541
is just that...

00:04:46.541 --> 00:04:47.791
an act.

00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:49.125
Behind those corny dad jokes

00:04:49.125 --> 00:04:51.791
is an insatiable appetite for adoration.

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:53.375
Kyrie, you must understand that

00:04:53.375 --> 00:04:54.583
with the Mediadel in shambles

00:04:54.583 --> 00:04:57.000
there is nobody to generate interest in our battles.

00:04:57.208 --> 00:04:58.875
Our ratings are dim.

00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:00.416
Our economy is failing.

00:05:00.416 --> 00:05:02.750
Every second a fanling isn’t obsessing on

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.083
Ben Simmons trade rumors

00:05:04.083 --> 00:05:05.875
or RJ Barrett’s progress

00:05:05.875 --> 00:05:08.375
is one they are spending exploring other passions

00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:10.416
like science, philosophy,

00:05:10.416 --> 00:05:11.291
or even worse,

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.333
spending time with their families.

00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:15.041
What can I say?

00:05:15.041 --> 00:05:16.708
I guess I ruined something else.

00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:17.625
We’re going to have to

00:05:17.625 --> 00:05:19.458
suspend you indefinitely for this.

00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:20.166
But,

00:05:20.166 --> 00:05:22.541
considering you are a star knight,

00:05:22.541 --> 00:05:24.333
we would be willing to commute your sentence

00:05:24.333 --> 00:05:24.875
if...

00:05:24.875 --> 00:05:27.000
you and your crew of...

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.000
"grumpy boys"

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.916
agree to rebuild the Mediadel.

00:05:29.916 --> 00:05:32.666
You’ve still got so much potential, Kyrie.

00:05:32.666 --> 00:05:34.583
Don’t waste it sulking here in the dark.

00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:36.541
Don’t tell me what to do.

00:05:36.541 --> 00:05:38.166
I’m not your sidekick anymore.

00:05:38.458 --> 00:05:39.458
Very well.

00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:45.708
Burned down the Mediadel, eh?

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.000
What!? Hello?

00:05:47.375 --> 00:05:50.291
I’ve burned a few things down in my day.

00:05:50.291 --> 00:05:53.166
OK. Like what?

00:05:53.666 --> 00:05:55.500
House Sixers.

00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:56.833
Maester Hinkie?

00:05:56.833 --> 00:05:58.666
How long have you been down here?

00:05:58.666 --> 00:06:00.291
Oh, quite some time.

00:06:00.291 --> 00:06:02.375
The only thing that sustains me is knowing that

00:06:02.375 --> 00:06:04.958
somewhere, beyond those bars,

00:06:04.958 --> 00:06:06.333
Joel Embiid,

00:06:06.333 --> 00:06:07.333
Ben Simmons

00:06:07.333 --> 00:06:08.750
and I assume Jayson Tatum

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.291
are now a dynasty.

00:06:10.291 --> 00:06:11.291
Tell me,

00:06:11.291 --> 00:06:13.291
how many championships have we won?

00:06:13.666 --> 00:06:14.791
Um...

00:06:14.791 --> 00:06:15.791
Oh, what I’d give

00:06:15.791 --> 00:06:17.291
for the chance to show the world

00:06:17.291 --> 00:06:19.541
I can do more than just burn things down.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.208
Tell me about it.

00:06:21.208 --> 00:06:22.916
Destruction is the easy part.

00:06:23.083 --> 00:06:25.166
Any cynic can tear things down

00:06:25.166 --> 00:06:26.875
and call themselves a genius,

00:06:26.875 --> 00:06:28.625
but it takes a true visionary

00:06:28.625 --> 00:06:30.500
to actually improve things,

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.208
to build a better world.

00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:33.416
That’s the part

00:06:33.416 --> 00:06:35.416
I was really looking forward to.

00:06:35.416 --> 00:06:37.750
That’s the real challenge.

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:43.125
So now you want us to just rebuild this place? 

00:06:43.125 --> 00:06:45.041
What about your whole rant about haters?

00:06:45.041 --> 00:06:45.666
I gotta say,

00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:47.500
being in the dungeon for almost a day

00:06:47.916 --> 00:06:49.125
really changed me.

00:06:49.125 --> 00:06:51.541
I realized the haters are what fuel us.

00:06:51.541 --> 00:06:53.625
Without conflict, there is no story.

00:06:53.625 --> 00:06:55.583
And our Realm is as much about the stories

00:06:55.583 --> 00:06:56.916
as the battles themselves.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.416
OK, well…

00:06:59.416 --> 00:07:00.416
also if we don’t rebuild this,

00:07:00.416 --> 00:07:01.583
we won’t be rich anymore and

00:07:01.583 --> 00:07:02.083
we’ll have to get real jobs.

00:07:02.083 --> 00:07:04.000
-I'm in
-That sounds good
-Works for me
-You got it

00:07:04.125 --> 00:07:05.166
So what do we do?

00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:07.583
Russ, you throw up bricks from a distance.

00:07:07.583 --> 00:07:09.083
Kevin, collect all your burners

00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:10.791
and start repopulating the ravenry.

00:07:10.791 --> 00:07:12.000
Draymond, you’re the guy

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.041
on the construction site that yells at everybody.

00:07:14.041 --> 00:07:14.708
Jimmy,

00:07:14.708 --> 00:07:16.083
you’re also that guy.

00:07:16.083 --> 00:07:16.708
Boogie,

00:07:16.708 --> 00:07:19.041
you’ll handle the engineering and blueprints.

00:07:19.041 --> 00:07:19.791
Why me?

00:07:19.791 --> 00:07:22.333
Because you’ve got vast experience with technicals.

00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:23.250
Swamp Dragon,

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.250
you’ll be doing the welding.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.250
And Melo,

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.083
you’re on the bench.

00:07:26.083 --> 00:07:28.041
Oh, come on. I’m good again!

00:07:34.208 --> 00:07:35.833
I gotta say, Kyrie,

00:07:35.833 --> 00:07:36.833
I'm impressed.

00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:38.875
This is a top-two Mediadel, all-time.

00:07:38.875 --> 00:07:40.833
There’s one last thing to do.

00:07:40.833 --> 00:07:42.583
All the books and histories of this Realm

00:07:42.583 --> 00:07:44.250
were destroyed in the fire.

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:45.541
They must be rewritten.

00:07:45.791 --> 00:07:47.916
Let the Truth fill these books.

00:07:52.541 --> 00:07:54.416
Ladies and gentlemen of Balleros,

00:07:54.416 --> 00:07:56.875
we are here to bestow upon King James

00:07:56.875 --> 00:07:58.833
the most exalted title of

00:07:58.833 --> 00:08:00.250
GOAT of GOATs.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.208
For he hath led his knights to victory

00:08:02.208 --> 00:08:04.875
against a foe once believed unbeatable,

00:08:04.875 --> 00:08:06.166
the Dream Team.

00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:06.958
In doing so

00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:09.083
he defeated prime Michael Jordan,

00:08:09.083 --> 00:08:10.708
earning him the title of

00:08:10.708 --> 00:08:12.958
the greatest knight of all time.

00:08:16.916 --> 00:08:18.291
Hashtag washed king, eh?

00:08:20.041 --> 00:08:21.666
Thank you everyone,

00:08:21.666 --> 00:08:23.666
but today isn’t really about me.

00:08:24.208 --> 00:08:25.958
It’s about my teammates.

00:08:25.958 --> 00:08:29.166
It’s about all the legends who came before me.

00:08:29.166 --> 00:08:31.041
Of course the fanlings, 

00:08:31.041 --> 00:08:32.583
the Mediadel maesters

00:08:32.583 --> 00:08:33.583
and the future GOATs who

00:08:33.583 --> 00:08:36.958
may one day take this crown from me.

00:08:36.958 --> 00:08:37.958
Thank you.

00:08:37.958 --> 00:08:38.833
Corny!

00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:41.375
Now, before we officially crown King James,

00:08:41.375 --> 00:08:43.000
are there any objections?

00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:48.916
Ehhhhhhhhhhhhh...

00:08:48.916 --> 00:08:51.583
Are we sure he’s better than Jordan?

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.000
I mean...

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.666
you could make the case...

00:08:58.666 --> 00:08:59.958
LeBron got lucky, you know?

00:08:59.958 --> 00:09:00.625
Hear hear!

00:09:00.625 --> 00:09:02.750
Yeah, I mean, I was at the battle,

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.541
and don’t get me wrong.

00:09:04.541 --> 00:09:06.625
LeBron was incredible.

00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:07.541
But…

00:09:07.541 --> 00:09:09.041
it was only one battle.

00:09:09.041 --> 00:09:10.416
Best of seven?

00:09:10.416 --> 00:09:12.125
I’m putting my money on Jordan.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.333
What?

00:09:13.333 --> 00:09:13.708
I don't know. 

00:09:13.708 --> 00:09:15.125
I gotta disagree with you, Chuck.

00:09:15.125 --> 00:09:18.333
I think now that these guys finally beat the Dream Team,

00:09:18.333 --> 00:09:20.625
I think that's all the evidence I need to say that

00:09:20.625 --> 00:09:21.625
the GOAT...

00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:22.708
it's gotta be Tatum, right?

00:09:22.708 --> 00:09:24.041
Right? It's gotta be Jayson Tatum.

00:09:24.041 --> 00:09:25.833
What? Jayson Tatum?

00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:27.333
Has everyone gone mad?

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:28.250
Where’s Nick Wright?

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.708
Think the dragon got him.

00:09:29.708 --> 00:09:31.291
Now hold on, everyone.

00:09:31.291 --> 00:09:33.291
I am lucky enough to witness 

00:09:33.291 --> 00:09:34.916
King James’ greatness,

00:09:34.916 --> 00:09:37.041
night in and night out.

00:09:37.041 --> 00:09:38.500
What he does at his age

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.875
is truly unprecedented.

00:09:40.875 --> 00:09:41.875
Thank you.

00:09:41.875 --> 00:09:44.708
That being said...

00:09:44.708 --> 00:09:45.333
What?

00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:47.708
One could argue...

00:09:47.708 --> 00:09:50.041
he’s not even the best knight on his own team.

00:09:50.291 --> 00:09:52.625
Well, now hold on.

00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:55.291
The numbers cannot be denied.

00:09:55.291 --> 00:09:57.041
I have amassed the most points

00:09:57.041 --> 00:09:59.541
of any knight in history.

00:09:59.541 --> 00:10:01.458
Also, six rings.

00:10:01.458 --> 00:10:04.750
Five more and you can talk, child.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.833
I have 11 reasons why I am the GOAT.

00:10:07.833 --> 00:10:10.208
I would kick LeBron’s ass!

00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:16.666
THIS DEBATE IS OVER.

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:19.916
I. AM. THE. GOAT.

00:10:21.791 --> 00:10:23.833
But let me ask you this.

00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:27.375
What does the word GOAT mean to you, anyway?

00:10:27.375 --> 00:10:29.833
-This should be good.
-Kyrie’s gonna throw someone under the bus!
-Everyone shush, I want to hear this!

00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:31.625
What makes a GOAT?

00:10:31.625 --> 00:10:33.291
Is it the rings?

00:10:33.291 --> 00:10:35.000
Is it the stats?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.875
Is it the style?

00:10:36.875 --> 00:10:38.166
No.

00:10:38.166 --> 00:10:39.708
It’s the story.

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:41.833
There’s nothing more powerful 

00:10:41.833 --> 00:10:43.875
than a good story.

00:10:43.875 --> 00:10:46.791
And who has a better story…

00:10:46.791 --> 00:10:48.125
than Paul Pierce?

00:10:48.125 --> 00:10:49.125
What?

00:10:49.125 --> 00:10:52.208
Paul Pierce not only has a championship ring,

00:10:52.208 --> 00:10:53.791
and was a 10-time All-Star,

00:10:54.291 --> 00:10:55.041
but he did it all

00:10:55.041 --> 00:10:56.958
after being stabbed.

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:59.541
He once hit a game-winning bank shot

00:10:59.541 --> 00:11:01.625
and when asked if he called ‘bank,’

00:11:01.625 --> 00:11:03.625
he said ‘I called game.’

00:11:04.625 --> 00:11:05.875
A crippled man

00:11:05.875 --> 00:11:07.458
who became the most interesting

00:11:07.458 --> 00:11:09.250
maester in the Mediadel

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:11.291
when he had the courage to say

00:11:11.291 --> 00:11:13.541
he was better than Dwyane Wade.

00:11:13.541 --> 00:11:14.333
He's right!

00:11:14.333 --> 00:11:15.958
Kyrie's right about something!

00:11:15.958 --> 00:11:18.208
That shot over Al Harrington was all-time!

00:11:18.833 --> 00:11:20.916
To Paul Pierce,

00:11:20.916 --> 00:11:22.250
the true GOAT!

00:11:23.375 --> 00:11:28.958
PAUL PIERCE! PAUL PIERCE! PAUL PIERCE!

